{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_32559","headline":"送友人擢第东归 · 刘驾","name":"送友人擢第东归","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"同家楚天南，相识秦云西。\n古来悬弧义，岂顾子与妻。\n携手践名场，正遇公道开。\n君荣我虽黜，感恩同所怀。\n有马不复羸，有奴不复饥。\n灞岸秋草绿，却是还家时。\n青门一瓢空，分手去迟迟。\n期君辙未平，我车继东归。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"刘驾","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_32559.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_32559","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}